  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\frac{d}{d y}\\left(\\frac{d x}{d y}\\right)=\\frac{d}{d y}\\left(\\frac{1}{\\left(\\frac{d y}{d x}\\right)}\\right)=-\\frac{1}{\\left(\\frac{d y}{d x}\\right)^2} \\frac{d}{d y}\\left(\\frac{d y}{d x}\\right)^2$\n$=-\\left(\\frac{d y}{d x}\\right)^{-2} \\frac{1}{\\left(\\frac{d y}{d x}\\right)} \\frac{d}{d x}\\left(\\frac{d y}{d x}\\right)=-\\left(\\frac{d^2 y}{d x^2}\\right)\\left(\\frac{d y}{d x}\\right)^{-3}$",
